## Modules

| Module                         | Subjects | Halves  | Entitlement gates             |
| ------------------------------ | -------- | ------- | ----------------------------- |
| [beta](modules/beta/README.md) | beta     | process | `enterprise` (`beta_runs`) ×1 |

